            <h2 style="color: white;">We Build Solutions That Grow With Your Business</h2>
            <p>At Ariesware, we don’t just develop software — we create scalable, secure, and 
            performance-driven digital solutions designed to solve real business problems.</p>
            <button>Get in Touch</button>
        </div>
   </section>
   <section class="Why">
    <div id="tsparticles"></div>
    <h5 style="font-size: 27px;color:#0097b2; font-weight: 300;">Our Values</h5>
    <h2 style="font-size: 45px;">We Focus on Creating Measurable Business Impact</h2>
    <div class="metrics">
        <div class="box">
            <svg width="60" height="60" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
