            <h3>Strategic & Scalable Development</h3>
            <p>Our solutions are scalable for future growth. We don’t build short-term fixes</p>
        </div>
        <div class="box">
            <svg width="60" height="60" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <path d="M12 3l7 4v5c0 5-3.5 8-7 9-3.5-1-7-4-7-9V7l7-4z"></path>
            <path d="M9 12l2 2 4-4"></path>
            </svg>
            <h3>Security & Reliability First</h3>
            <p>We prioritize secure authentication systems. Your data and systems stay protected.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="box">
            <svg width="60" height="60" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <path d="M21 15a4 4 0 0 1-4 4H8l-5 3V7a4 4 0 0 1 4-4h10a4 4 0 0 1 4 4z"></path>
            <line x1="8" y1="10" x2="16" y2="10"></line>
            <line x1="8" y1="14" x2="13" y2="14"></line>
            </svg>
            <h3>Transparent Communication</h3>
            <p>We believe in clear timelines, regular updates. You’re part of the process — not just a custom</p>
        </div>
        </div>
